  dialogueLines:
  - Good morning! You look exhausted. I saw your lights on at 3 AM. Are you having trouble sleeping?
  - Oh, you poor thing. Don't work too hard, dear.
  - A pet? I didn't know you had one. What kind of animal is up at 3 AM?
  - At 3 AM? With all that weird thumping? How strange.
